From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron contributors <electron@github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0000
Subject: feat: support independently owned webview2 contents

Authorize Electron's narrow unowned bridge, notify after complete unowned
attachment teardown, and carry the opt-in webview2 preference to renderers.
WebContents ownership stays with the application across iframe teardown.

diff --git a/content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc b/content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc
index 450079a0a8..00bf264377 100644
--- a/content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc
+++ b/content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc
@@ -3657,6 +3657,9 @@ void WebContentsImpl::DetachUnownedInnerWebContents(
   }
 
   inner_main_frame->UpdateAXTreeData();
+  observers_.NotifyObservers(
+      &WebContentsObserver::UnownedInnerWebContentsDetached,
+      inner_web_contents_impl);
 }
 
 SurfaceEmbedConnector* WebContentsImpl::GetSurfaceEmbedConnector() const {
